  "steps": [
    "Blanch 2 spinach bundles & blend them into a thick paste.",
    "1 tbsp oil, 1 tsp jeera, 1 tsp garlic, chopped, 1/2 inch ginger, chopped, 1 green chili, chopped. Sauté till fragrant.",
    "Add the palak paste, salt to taste, 1 tsp coriander powder, 1/2 tsp garam masala powder. Mix well.",
    "1/4 cup roasted besan, 1/4 cup cashew powder. Mix well & cook till thickened.",
    "For the gravy: 1 tbsp oil, 1 tsp jeera, 1/2 inch cinnamon stick, 1 bay leaf, a few black peppercorns, 3 green cardamom, 1 black cardamom, 1 tsp garlic, chopped, 1 inch ginger, chopped, 1 green chili, chopped, 2 onions, diced, 5 tomatoes, diced, 1 tsp coriander powder, 1 tsp red chili powder, 1/4 tsp haldi powder, 1/4 tsp garam masala powder, salt to taste, a handful of cashews, 1 tsp kasuri methi. Mix well.",
    "Add 1 cup water & cook for 1/2 hour on slow flame.",
    "Remove the whole spices & blend into a smooth paste.",
    "1 tbsp butter, 1 tsp honey. Mix well. 2 tbsp fresh cream. Mix well.",
    "For the paneer mixture: 250g paneer, crumbled, 1 tsp black pepper powder, 1/2 tsp fresh coriander, chopped. Mix well & shape them into balls.",
    "Flatten the palak mixture & stuff with the paneer mixture.",
    "Lightly coat in corn flour & fry till GBC.",
    "Serve the gravy with the koftas."
  ],
